  {
   "id": "e5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 800,
   "height": 39.0,
   "text": "2. BRANCH: one branch, one PR per task. New copilot/ branch from the base branch you pick,\n   or the PR's own branch when you @copilot on a PR. Set by the execution context, not the agent profile",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
   "originalText": "2. BRANCH: one branch, one PR per task. New copilot/ branch from the base branch you pick,\n   or the PR's own branch when you @copilot on a PR. Set by the execution context, not the agent profile"
  },
  {
   "id": "e6",
   "type": "rectangle",
