  {
   "id": "e9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 130,
   "y": 240,
   "width": 800,
   "height": 58.5,
   "text": "4. REVIEW: only users with write access can trigger it. It opens a draft PR; a human must review\n   and merge. The requester can't approve it. Workflows wait for 'Approve and run workflows'.\n   Simple pushes only: no direct git push.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
